Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摇摇杯一年份
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那球出界了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.77,0:00:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:34.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是在这里做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈妈很担心你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点回去好好道个歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻奈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朝雾台
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  等等
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.25,0:01:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被甩了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么…要见面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为有事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.21,0:02:55.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不见  没有见面的必要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作的事啊  我不会做什么的  真的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.77,0:03:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,城里的咖啡店的话什么都做不了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遥  能打个电话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电话没通  而且也没有电
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然水倒是有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公共电话呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.60,0:03:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走过去得一小时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法  用这个回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便给她送回去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥  既然来了就放松一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:51.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我陪你打吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去跑步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么停下了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱…抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.56,0:04:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺带说下  我用的是流行风格
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不记得有用现代曲风作曲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请不要随意改编
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.73,0:04:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有报警吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦不  我倒不是害怕警察
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:05:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是会被老爸啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能报警…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.71,0:05:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,揭自己的丑这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:08.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子已经没事了么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:10.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背包男帮了你一回吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你指谁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好啊  有那么多男人保护你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作上的事是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.17,0:05:28.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要写些文章
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,文章？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在在做自由记者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.01,0:05:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了些题材  想写成报道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己写不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也知道的吧  我的「文采」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.17,0:05:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么题材
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.17,0:05:51.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在的…背包男的那个  就上次那个男的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.19,0:05:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藤井君不是那样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对对  就是那个藤井
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他和森川由绮的经纪人搞上了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说…什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看了这些也不信？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.02,0:06:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会…骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藤井君可是和由绮…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  森川由绮的男人原来是那家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  这由你来写不是最省事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.89,0:06:27.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且你还可以省略掉那些不利于你的事  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那怎么行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在做什么啊  那个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔  来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.35,0:06:38.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱…抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给她了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.20,0:06:42.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  这些…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收了钱就把底片给她了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.67,0:06:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是交易吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.73,0:07:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你蠢啊  这还是敲诈吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要是报警了怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好痛  饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  美咲真是好说话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.94,0:07:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恢复关系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恢复？和谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到两年前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以这些照片请不要发表
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两年前难道说是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为被缠着实在太烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:35.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就拜托老爸塞了钱才甩掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个自认超有人气的女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才没有…收钱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还怀恨在心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是服了  服了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:50.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真以为所有男人都会被你迷倒？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:55.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太贱了  太贱了啊  美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.18,0:07:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  是太贱了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不知道他给你下了什么药
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这种男人  你再怎么让步他也不会满足的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小…小玛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见了呢  健一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多…多多多日…不见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为…为什么在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大呼小叫会吵到其他客人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且这不是秘密的谈话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可是受到了整家店的关注了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都听到了  放弃这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.93,0:08:42.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管这种小题材了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会给你个更棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.79,0:08:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脱了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也得脱？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脱了  坐这边来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.97,0:09:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个男人在比较有气氛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用露脸的  快点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边的  好好拍哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是真的吗  太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.25,0:09:42.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个小玛居然…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:46.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  那个小玛居然做了这样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.91,0:09:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我并没有那个意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能写吗  美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.99,0:09:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要写的只有我的题材
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:09:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于冬弥君的全部扔了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.99,0:09:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说定了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然小玛开口就一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.51,0:10:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就没你事了  快滚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久没见了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后一起去吃个饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道家不错的烤肉店
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:15.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事务所应该在找我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多应该已经要报警了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.13,0:10:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是歌手…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多吧  虽然不怎么有名
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.85,0:10:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我不太了解
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.60,0:10:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识田丸君吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  以前认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他追过我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好吗  说了那种话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.14,0:10:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去拒绝…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不行  还是写吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正都知道了情况
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你不写  也会有人写了发表
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的那些料都是为了让他们老实的诱饵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要拜托你的另有其事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.99,0:11:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在要说的才是正经事  你会帮忙的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…我什么都…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.47,0:11:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要做的事都一样  录音采访的报道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以你的感觉稍微改编一下  写得感动点就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会给你报酬的  信用上也不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.31,0:11:35.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杂志的名字给你听到没准会吓你一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.49,0:11:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实编辑部那边的工作也做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划也完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:44.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:47.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了  拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.07,0:11:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以问个问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.78,0:11:52.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么快就开始么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要做这样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:12:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理由…是泽仓小姐吧  冬弥君的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:04.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从高中开始我就是他的前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.09,0:12:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…你和藤井君是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青梅竹马吧  某种意义上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外…和你一样  是女神
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:23.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么开始正式采访吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:48.49,INJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,341,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(4137,4370,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}見つめてたあなたのこと　ずっと…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:48.49,INCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,341,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(4137,4370,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}不停注视着你…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:51.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和神崎社长联系上了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.11,0:12:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也因为工作没能参加成人式
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.47,0:13:01.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过有穿着盛装  照片下次会刊登…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…虽然不一定能上  请在杂志上看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还在上课  休息时间马上就要结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就这样  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不谨慎？我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过太好了  真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.37,0:14:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚饭的准备呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去家庭餐厅吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.17,0:14:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有煤气的啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.97,0:14:55.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遥…你…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.09,0:14:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我姑且也算个男人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  那么做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.95,0:15:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥来做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.44,0:15:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿点什么  会感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要说得像哥哥一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:19.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的也是  我不是你哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:21.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥是我的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都不是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.15,0:15:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要再一个人了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.39,0:15:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遥我说过的吧  那里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.11,0:15:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁的位子  麻奈的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.10,0:15:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是由绮的位子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:50.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是空着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.29,0:15:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遥  放开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.92,0:15:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:55.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么一定要放开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:15:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明你是知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明以前就知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:02.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却装作不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装成朋友  装成哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.02,0:16:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装成什么都不是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明连由绮都是中途插进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.43,0:16:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是回去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.81,0:16:31.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是去清醒下头脑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  您好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然还没回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是因为我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点关系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天大概就没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骑着自行车  只要不迷路的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请收下这些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请躺着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:17:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间差不多我就会离开的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  自我介绍晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:06.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫作  观月麻奈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.93,0:17:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…是藤井老师的不争气的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:13.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.75,0:17:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您说什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.67,0:17:17.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又和遥…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么您会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过也是我间接造成这个结果的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.18,0:17:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是要说起因的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的孩子和我妈妈串通起来让我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是麻烦的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会…我已经放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是跟在遥的身后
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒也不是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个该说吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您知道吗  您孩子的女朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:57.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不知道谁是男孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:18:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是啊  很温柔哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.11,0:18:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和死去的母亲很像
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥马上就会回来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里等会就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.09,0:18:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人火大的老头…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.84,0:18:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.88,0:18:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:48.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会忘记呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起色心了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.14,0:18:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起个头
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是  向你撒娇了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.26,0:19:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利用你的温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是用来当借口
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.94,0:19:19.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为道歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.59,0:19:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不小气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的回来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.27,0:20:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好乖  好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么早打扰  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.48,0:20:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经出门了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.17,0:20:43.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是说还在睡觉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天…哦已经是前天了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.76,0:20:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然让她担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.30,0:20:52.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过还是给神崎社长打了电话  总算是解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想说的就这些
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等会也要去工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么再见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.21,0:21:11.08,up,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}去看望藤井老师的父亲了  麻奈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛瑙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:21.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了哦  专辑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.01,0:21:31.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好  去公寓看了下你已经出门了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天虽然没打算住在朋友家的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.83,0:21:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一不注意就睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.85,0:21:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.97,0:21:42.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种时候该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.38,0:21:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大声斥责吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是说该哭泣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者像之前那样打你的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.79,0:21:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.33,0:21:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理奈  我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.35,0:21:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  马上就要上场了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.91,0:22:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去外面等着
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.92,0:24:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二十三页
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.61,0:24:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了探病和亲手做的料理而渴望染上感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.58,0:24:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却没有想过之后有多痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.72,0:24:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,White  Album
